      "text": "WHAT YOU'D ADD TODAY \u2014 say this before they ask\nNo formal drift monitoring at handover. In EdTech the label arrives\nmonths late, so you monitor feature/prediction drift now and model\nquality on a delayed labelled sample. That gap is the honest answer.",
